{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 32, :comments ["<b>And now.</b> I have already explained in the book of Daniel and Sepharim Petiva (Daniel 7:10) that all decrees upon collectivities and upon individuals are in the configurations of the heavens. And thus the sages of Benei Yeshiva acknowledged: life, children, and sustenance—only HaShem adds on account of His fear, as I have explained it."], :book :exodus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 32, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:39:57.664535965Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}